@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` is an asynchronous factory. The runtime supplies its canonical-instruction loader, which must resolve `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md`; the factory awaits that content and assigns it to the agent's `instruction` field.
+
+The returned runtime object identifies `order-triage`, fixes its action as `classify-for-human-review`, and sets `canApproveRefunds` to `false`. No provider integration or model-visible tools are established by this project.
